{"version": 2, "width": 100, "height": 32, "timestamp": 1790367778, "title": "SVRF demo: a braided train landing eight pull requests", "env": {"TERM": "xterm-256color", "SHELL": "/bin/bash"}}
[0.0, "o", "$ python3 demo/run_demo.py\r\n"]
[0.344347, "o", "\r\n== Six agents open eight pull requests against the toy project ==\r\n"]
[0.670803, "o", "  #1 'Add subtract' (ada): ordinary feature\r\n  #2 'Add multiply' (bo): ordinary feature (parent of a stacked PR)\r\n  #3 'Set mode to safe' (cy): changes MODE\r\n  #4 'Set mode to turbo' (di): changes MODE too: conflicts\r\n  #5 'Add divide' (ed): its own test fails\r\n"]
[0.670812, "o", "  #6 'Add power' (fay): code committed before its test\r\n  #7 'Add square' (bo): stacked on #2 (bo/multiply)\r\n  #8 'Add negate' (ada): ordinary feature\r\n\r\n== Configuring the train (the gate is the toy project's own unit tests) ==\r\n"]
[0.678166, "o", "\r\n== Running the train, one round per tick, until it goes idle ==\r\n"]
[1.396859, "o", "  tick 1: RAN; merged #1, #2, #3, #8; held #5; relanded #6 -> #9\r\n"]
[1.464356, "o", "  tick 2: RAN; held #4; repaired #9; retargeted #7\r\n"]
[1.672339, "o", "  tick 3: RAN; merged #9; repaired #7\r\n"]
[1.751392, "o", "  tick 4: RAN; repaired #7\r\n"]
[1.88574, "o", "  tick 5: RAN; merged #7\r\n"]
[1.90838, "o", "  tick 6: IDLE\r\n\r\n== Done: what landed, what's still held ==\r\n"]
[1.908868, "o", "PR  agent  title              what the agent did                         result      detail\r\n--  -----  -----------------  -----------------------------------------  ----------  ------------------------------------------------------------\r\n#1  ada    Add subtract       ordinary feature                           merged      round 1\r\n#2  bo     Add multiply       ordinary feature (parent of a stacked PR)  merged      round 1\r\n#3  cy     Set mode to safe   changes MODE                               merged      round 1\r\n#4  di     Set mode to turbo  changes MODE too: conflicts                held        ADMISSION_HELD: merge:CONFLICT:tests/test_settings.py\r\n"]
[1.90887, "o", "#5  ed     Add divide         its own test fails                         held        GATE_RED: FAIL: test_divide (test_divide.Divide.test_divide)\r\n#6  fay    Add power          code committed before its test             superseded  re-landed in order as #9\r\n#7  bo     Add square         stacked on #2 (bo/multiply)                merged      round 5\r\n#8  ada    Add negate         ordinary feature                           merged      round 1\r\n#9  svrf   Add power          opened by the train for #6                 merged      round 3\r\n\r\nrounds: 6   gates run: 6   merges: 5   landed tree == gated tree for every merge: True   wall: 1.2 s\r\nrepaired by union merge (CHANGELOG.md): #7, #9\r\nretargeted to main after the parent merged: #7"]
[1.908874, "o", "\r\nleft out of a round for a pairwise conflict: #4\r\n"]
